    <string name="live_recognition_instructions">Qondisa ikhamera yangemuva kulokho ofuna kuchazwe. Ku-Khomba ufunde, khomba umbhalo osesithombeni sekhamera ngomunwe. Izincazelo zingaba yiphutha. Ungazethembi ukuze uhambe ngokuphephile.</string>
